  "result": "Perfect! All 66 tests pass, including the 16 new tests for invoice numbering and issuing.\n\n**Created src/numbering.js:**\n- `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)` \u2014 generates the next invoice number\n  - Format: INV-YYYY-NNNN where NNNN is zero-padded 4-digit counter\n  - Counters restart each year\n  - Tracks only numbers from the same year as issueDate\n  - Handles unordered input and gaps in numbering\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- `issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)` \u2014 issues a draft invoice\n  - Only works on draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT error if not)\n  - Assigns a number using nextInvoiceNumber\n  - Changes status from 'draft' to 'issued'\n  - Preserves all invoice data (customerId, issueDate, lines, etc.)\n  - Never mutates input\n\n**Added 16 tests:**\n- 9 tests for nextInvoiceNumber covering empty/single/multiple numbers, year handling, ordering, and padding\n- 7 tests for issueInvoice covering successful issuing, error handling, data preservation, immutability, and year handling",
